{"availability":"available","full":"openabdev/openab","name":"openab","description":"A lightweight, secure, cloud-native ACP harness that bridges Discord and any ACP-compatible coding CLI.","category":"Other","language":"Rust","stars":816,"forks":210,"created":"2026-04-03T12:15:54Z","updated":"2026-10-05T21:05:21Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://openabdev.github.io/openab/","topics":[],"demo":"https://openabdev.github.io/openab/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-07T02:54:12.104Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-07T02:54:12.104Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-07T02:54:12.104Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-07T02:54:12.104Z","stars":816,"forks":210}],"technologies":["Rust"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A lightweight, secure, cloud-native ACP harness that bridges Discord, Slack, and any Agent Client Protocol-compatible coding CLI (Kiro CLI, Claude Code, Codex, Gemini, OpenCode, MiMo-Code, Kimi Code, Copilot CLI, Grok Build, Devin, Antigravity, Pi, etc.) over stdio JSON-RPC — delivering the next-generation development experience. Telegram, LINE, Feishu/Lark, Google Chat, WeCom, and Microsoft Teams are available through gateway adapters, either compiled into the unified binary or deployed as the standalone Custom Gateway.","🪼 Join our community! Come say hi on Discord — we'd love to have you: 🪼 OpenAB — Official 🎉","OpenAB remains a thin broker: platform adapters converge on the same dispatcher and session pool, then cross one ACP stdio boundary to the selected agent runtime. Gateway adapters can run as a standalone companion or be embedded in a unified build without changing that boundary. Platform-edge labels distinguish inbound delivery from outbound replies: webhook/API for webhook platforms and WS/webhook for Feishu/Lark."],"features":["Multi-platform — supports Discord and Slack, run one or both simultaneously","Gateway adapters — extend to Telegram, LINE, Feishu/Lark, Google Chat, WeCom, and Microsoft Teams through the standalone gateway or an opt-in unified build","Pluggable agent backend — swap between Kiro CLI, Claude Code, Codex, Gemini, OpenCode, MiMo-Code, Kimi Code, Copilot CLI, Grok Build, Devin, Antigravity, Pi via config","@mention trigger — mention the bot in an allowed channel to start a conversation","Thread-based multi-turn — auto-creates threads; no @mention needed for follow-ups"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/openabdev/openab/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"cb7636d500808b68d287e15e07b38ba1683e492a9a7264cb92aec53a82199512","extractedAt":"2026-10-07T02:54:12.259Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-07T02:54:12.259Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A lightweight, secure, cloud-native ACP harness that bridges Discord, Slack, and any Agent Client Protocol-compatible coding CLI (Kiro CLI, Claude Code, Codex, Gemini, OpenCode, MiMo-Code, Kimi Code, Copilot CLI, Grok Build, Devin, Antigravity, Pi, etc.) over stdio JSON-RPC — delivering the next-generation development experience. Telegram, LINE, Feishu/Lark, Google Chat, WeCom, and Microsoft Teams are available through gateway adapters, either compiled into the unified binary or deployed as the standalone Custom Gateway.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/openabdev/openab/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"cb7636d500808b68d287e15e07b38ba1683e492a9a7264cb92aec53a82199512","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/openabdev/openab/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-07T02:54:12.259Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-05T21:05:21Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/openabdev/openab/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-07T02:54:12.260Z","hash":"cb7636d500808b68d287e15e07b38ba1683e492a9a7264cb92aec53a82199512","originalBytes":17279,"storedBytes":17279,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["docs","acp","openab","gateway","agent","custom","discord","bot","see","slack","token","cli","standalone","user","webhook","native","api